 - Added in the **Info Screen** a new **Score Tab** showing a **sortable (default ordered by highest score) table** with all relevant scoreboard fields, plus **new fields** like Player color, Player ID (to distinguish identical Name/Civ/Leader/Player Color), (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5532+) Traits (T1 and T2) as **icon chars**, total Power (of a player, distinct from power ratios), total Power per City, Land%, V/M, Tech (total techs). Added a clickable **"Legend"** text that **redirects to Sevopedia Concepts' "Score Tab Columns" page**. Note that unlike military ratios, PowT and PoT/C are shown even for the human player, since these vary every turn. Change in [CvInfoScreen.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvInfoScreen.py). See [README.md: Score Tab](/README.md#score-tab-in-the-info-screen-advisor).
 - Beautified the **Victory Screen**: **added Buttons/Icons** (Leaders, Religions, Apostolic Palace, UN, Spaceship parts, Traits as chars, etc.), **Thousands Separators**, **Victory Culture Percentages** (mirroring the changes in [CvInfoScreen.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvInfoScreen.py)). (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5523+) **Always show** the **Resolutions** and **Members** tabs so now all tabs are shown **even if they are empty**, and add a **fallback table** showing **required wonders** (as of now Apostolic Palace or United Nations) to make these tabs active for exhaustiveness and clarity. Change in [CvVictoryScreen.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvVictoryScreen.py). See also [KI#115](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Known_Issues.md#115---fixed-likely-base-advciv-issue-victory-screen-vote-requirement-text-spacing-in-resolutions-tab).
 - Beautified the **Diplomacy Screen**'s **trading rows** with **icons** (e.g., Gold, Gold Per Turn, World Map, Open Borders, Vassal, Defensive Pact; and **leader icons** (make peace / declare war / embargo)). Change in `CvPlayer::getItemTradeString`. See [README.md: Diplomacy Screen](/README.md#diplomacy-screen).
-- **Main Interface (Common)**: Moved **minimap to the right-edge** for quicker read. Add **details** to most **progress bars**; e.g. in the Tech bar `Fusion: 2245 / 5774 (35)`. Show **chars in the GP bar even if 100%** (e.g. `Great Scientist: Lyons (3) - [RESEARCH_CHAR] 100%`) Change in [GPUtil.py](/Assets/Python/BUG/GPUtil.py) and [CvMainInterface.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvMainInterface.py). (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5514+) **Swap top left** (e.g., Treasury) **and top right** (e.g., Turn and Year) **text position**, and optionally **move commerce sliders to the right side** (allows to freely expand advisors so they use the entire left side, and is visually closer to scoreboard and most mouse controls) **in city screen or map view**. **Reduce commerce sliders fast increment** (`++ and --` optional buttons) from **100 to 50** and make them **tunable**. Show **Era text default ON** (as of now on top left); **strip " Era" suffix** so text is now only e.g., `Renaissance` not `Renaissance Era` (would overflow during golden age when text is upscaled, plus it is unneeded). See [Main interface rework](/README.md#main-interface-rework).
-- **Main Interface (City Screen)**: Enhanced with a new **Great Person +n ICON** information in relevant Buildings' rows; added a new **Specialists Breakdown** and **Culture Breakdown**; added **optional extra rows** in the **Production Chooser Bar** ((Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5690+) with optional separate blue ribbon, bar Y position and bar height position fine-tuning tunables (e.g., helps remove needless scroll bar when there are not more than max rows, or keep display symetric or prettier)) and **optionally hide the unit bar** (`"PlotListPanel"`) (note: does not affect the production chooser outside of the city screen); added **Buttons** (i.e. icons) in the **Production Queue**; fixed some hard anchored items that now **dynamically** adjust to sides' width. **Beautified** it as well: removed the 3 gray bars ("Trade Routes", "Buildings", "Specialists"), increased sides' width, made bonuses columns even in width, and other changes. These changes allow to now display more information and reduce the need for scrolling or hovering. Also **enlarged** the **Bottom-Left** and **Bottom-Right** panels so they align dynamically with the enlarged **Side Panels**. Enhanced the **city bar** and **other bars**, e.g., `Lakamha: 16 - 12372 (4500BC)` or `Growing - 30/43 (4 Turns)`. Split the **Draft group** into hurry controls on the right (and a **new draft button**) and config options on the right. Add building list filtering buttons ("Show All Buildings", "Show Regular Buildings Only", "Show National Wonders Only", "Show World Wonders Only"). (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5526+) Reduce **food/production top bars' size** so text does not overflow when upscaled (also helps preserve overall distance to side panels due to increasing base font size from body to label). Change in [CvMainInterface.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvMainInterface.py). (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5689+) Adjust **city camera** to the north (tunable) so extra rows can be shown without overflowing into bottom BFC plots in `CvGame::onCityScreenChange`. And other changes. See also [KI#101](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Known_Issues.md#101---fixed-base-advciv-bug-of-gp-bar-tooltip-in-city-screen-not-showing-gp-from-obsolete-buildings-yet-seemignly-counting-them-for-the-total-gp-calculation).
